# Phase 13 (Commit 3): Windows launcher batch files must be checked out
# with CRLF line endings on every platform. cmd.exe batch parsing (labels,
# goto, subroutine calls, for loops) is not reliable on LF-only files, so
# the launcher contract (docs/PHASE13_STATE.md section 17) requires CRLF
# at checkout regardless of the local git autocrlf setting.
*.bat text eol=crlf
